{"group_identity":"83c8cc08d55e3384c9d7dc016be702ca32bf70a226325243cfa8247632425752","payload":{"attempt":1,"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1_lane_group","cycle":0,"group_id":"group-000","lane_boundaries":[{"index":1,"length":20,"offset":0},{"index":2,"length":20,"offset":20},{"index":3,"length":20,"offset":40},{"index":4,"length":20,"offset":60}],"lane_count":4,"lanes":[{"candidate_identity":"8d35cafe73850f117d3ac4f6581a7cc11eadb9d63c93a1e8eeea79288dec1a97","dispatch_id":"lane-000-0","index":1,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-9762ac4184dbef00478c/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-0.json"},{"candidate_identity":"650999017fb0400856092832911b8322b1d57fbebb8eb6cc5778f59b35cd6788","dispatch_id":"lane-000-1","index":2,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-9762ac4184dbef00478c/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-1.json"},{"candidate_identity":"d85a7e69c7d2bf9f4b4056ce9924d415458f91eae142ccdb3b4d80f5032a9809","dispatch_id":"lane-000-2","index":3,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-9762ac4184dbef00478c/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-2.json"},{"candidate_identity":"bc09f9a3f1323d9fc2f91dfc7521c38c122ebcac43624083040510684d50126f","dispatch_id":"lane-000-3","index":4,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-9762ac4184dbef00478c/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-3.json"}],"review_phase":"REVIEW","task_id":"batch-9762ac4184dbef00478c","workset":{"entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6210bfc2626e7c2dee793dcbc6b3af168008c6a262a99b47504f4815b390614c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"05587ac7af2f6397af817e0a410c330cef8d7d7bf53e139fb24bf99a4ae17655","logical_entry_identity":"84eec5e157abae8be15f5c7481d3cc3de399a2cfbccc262f5601e7f6dda7dfec","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Stairs seem to lead into some kind of crypt.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这道楼梯似乎通向某种地宫。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"87e571d7559c519972a97e78013f4ed8541145037251e61556ab90bc5fea6327","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0adffc30ac30a7df7c038dd7152bd8620092250c1f77b3f040babb52375fa23f","logical_entry_identity":"1e46ae1c348ec5db3cbacc78627fc5d9fcd1783c66a35b7434a7a37890316e49","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I must say, as time grows, I feel so do I grow more and more inclined to distance myself from the calling of an 'adventurer', like so many you can find roaming the countryside. I feel like the myth of a wandering hero has blinded too many with promise of easy fame and riches, with no eye for the other kind of fortune.\n\nHear me out on this.\n\nNowadays most don't really recognize how fascinating the world we live in truly is. It is vast, more than you can imagine. I can safely promise, any wild thought you can muster up, dear reader, will not come close to the truth. Such is the breadth of wonders, I would probably dismiss most of what I have seen as myth, be I not there myself. And even then sometimes, I had to wonder whether I could trust my eyes.\n\nPerhaps I'm being too vague, or maybe these promises leave much to be desired. After all, adventuring is not all fun and exotics, it is before all danger and a constant threat of death, or worse. So then if you wish me to be more concrete, think of derelict, crumbling crypts, cults and demons, hungry forests full of monsters and forces beyond time and place. True, there is overwhelming awe, thrill even, but the reason that so little detail reaches you, is because so little live to tell.\n\nWhat does reach us then, are not people, but objects. Artifacts of great power, legacy of the past. Surely, any drunkard might like to tell tales after a pint or two, but a magical sword is a proof of its own and it keeps quiet of what it has seen. So, a great hero is usually easy to recognize, being practically a walking history book. Clad in half the age of important events which he probably has no idea about.\n\nIt is important to remember, that every artifact has a meaning, beings of great power and importance behind them. Stories, that now slowly wane into nothing. This is why it is not artifacts that make an adventurer. It is his great deeds, the will to dare where nobody did before. It is not important if you get known in the process or not, after all, if you were truly great, maybe you will leave behind a legacy of your own.\n\n-#{italic}#Kestin Highfin#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"我必须说，随着漫长的冒险岁月，我似乎与那些在你们眼中的“冒险家”，也就是那群在乡间小路上的流浪者们渐行渐远。我想，或许是那些流浪英雄的神话使得那些金钱和荣誉的诱惑蒙蔽了你的双眼，让你们忽视了真正的财富就在我们的身边。\n\n诸君啊，敬请听我一言。\n\n现在，许多年轻人根本无法理解，我们身处的这个世界究竟是多么神奇而又美好，远远超出了任何人的想象。我向你们中任何一人保证，亲爱的读者啊，无论是在你脑海中多么狂野的梦想，在那无比瑰丽的真实世界面前都是那么渺小，这就是真正奇迹的恢弘气势。即使我将一切我未能亲身经历的故事全部当作神话，天哪，我所亲历的一切仍然是那么震撼人心，让我甚至无法相信我的亲眼所见。\n\n或许，我的描述有些过于模糊，或许，这些保证有些难以置信。毕竟，冒险并不总是充满了探索未知的喜悦——那是前所未有的危险，无时无刻不伴随着死亡的威胁，甚至更糟。所以，如果你想要让我用语言描述的话——请想象一下，废弃的远古地宫里巨岩崩碎跌落；疯狂的邪教徒将恶魔从异次元唤来；随着远处猛兽的咆哮，外表平和的森林展露了它嗜血的本性；还有，与之伴随的，超越时空约束的强大力量。这就是真实的冒险，任何人都会为其壮丽景象所倾倒，为其沉醉——尽管，我们所能了解的实在只是冒险旅途的吉光片羽，毕竟只有极少一部分的人能生还下来，告诉我们他们真实的经历。\n\n如果要说我们能够亲眼所见的是什么，那就往往是那些过去和现在伟大冒险家的遗物：那是身怀着强大力量的神器，诉说着真正的史诗。当然，在灌下一两杯之后任何一个醉鬼都能够信口开河，胡诌一通；然而，一把灌注着强大魔力的利刃从来不会说谎，它们是冒险史诗的诚实记录者，然而始终保持缄默，从不多言。所以说，一个伟大的英雄往往在装备上就引人注目。他们如同活动着的历史，身上的每一件物品都诉说着宏大的史诗，其中至少有一半连他的主人都没有丝毫了解。\n\n要记住重要的是，每一件神器都有其自己的意义，如同曾经手持他们的那些值得在史册留名的伟大英雄。尽管他们的故事已经被人们渐渐淡忘，他们的遗物仍然在世间永存。这就是为什么说，真正的英雄并不是因为他的财富扬名立万。真正的冒险家永远无畏于挑战前人所不敢为之事，无论他们的功绩是否为人所记载。无论如何，你伟大的冒险经历将开创属于你自己的史诗。\n\n——#{italic}#科斯汀·赫菲因#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"754eb825f477ae02eacba1e24e625de8139b3d9cf7b3da01f6d96ca6aa420e81","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22336c5dbb405fb54e136bd96b0a82e7c1ff51d286bbba3b07609e82f2ddfa50","logical_entry_identity":"379eb204b7c98e890e39af7679422c6d140b50487f741fbfcee35ce074286f27","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"disembowelled","source_tag":"_t","target":"被撕裂胸膛"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"60454ca64ca7e64389702ccbb159395711e47648120b8b405d94e4a75af346d8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2239bb35c580f86360a49f3adfc953daac48ad45c9c23d4c22f437aef46b6d54","logical_entry_identity":"9696ee7dcfe167b0bd752a8bd35deb9ddf76d966118405226558a481eb4e9e4e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"That seems... unwise. My apologies, but I must refuse.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这似乎不是明智之举，很抱歉，我必须拒绝。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1bead848205c46e27ec971d25603027e747fec439c7d2e7c512870a57ef14dd7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2239e58aae49f4ce9905d0f48e3c3bcb4c1428f9dd5948b29a16921576d50608","logical_entry_identity":"b6d0eac299de062dfac525827c1423d99f6d5b59bfa622a8d3d348fcc7c65979","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"shimmering scale","source_tag":"_t","target":"闪光的鳞片"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b9b4a82aa336012c445804a57613b72a5532174fcf53e32fdf66dae4c4cfd929","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"224040d1005541e96c5ae73e69d9ad4812d96be70c158efd3d78b3786660d7f8","logical_entry_identity":"b889c42d66178379a28b188fa4e344282799eea5a9964e2e757326dbe355ccb6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You fire two arrows at your target, hitting it and a nearby foe if possible, doing %d%% damage\n\t\tThis talent does not use any stamina.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你向目标同时射出 2 支箭，对目标及其周围的一个敌人造成 %d%% 伤害。\n\t\t此技能不消耗体力值。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"41ae63acdabab79f3ebf39d213f716b1d419fabe8e624db668ce551b6e4dcc27","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2240f407e2439d1da48a794afbc681faa78f7f5c4be803b76635cdf28cb6143f","logical_entry_identity":"3639aad7cb8bcb2246ed3120ed6cdcc99ebbe8025b55dea1515528294077d65c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Almost Master of Arena","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"接近竞技场主宰"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2ee236dd90b79b79ea60f34395755423ac994e05a7b792df593190c4e787f0ef","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22432565ecd2702654860521045744d309a5fac26567ae58e1c7a6bc994fe21e","logical_entry_identity":"c66c7911efc468a5a3f871ed23088bdbfc0e6742b74169af2e35d8935fd47656","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*After a great deal of pounding, a halfling wrapped in charred, smoking robes opens the door. He looks irritated.*#WHITE#\nIT'S NOT ENOUGH THAT I WORK ALL MORNING TO MAKE A POTION THAT ENDS UP NEARLY BLOWING MY ASS OFF, BUT NOW I'VE GOT IDIOTS BEATING DOWN MY DAMNED FRONT DOOR WITH WHAT SOUNDS LIKE A BATTERING RAM, AND YES, I HEARD IT, THOUGH I CAN HARDLY MAKE OUT A BLEEDING THING WITH THESE BLEEDING, CONCUSSED EARS. WHAT DO YOU WANT?","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你敲了半天的门，终于有个穿着烧焦且冒着烟的长袍半身人开了门，他看上去很不高兴。*#WHITE#\n这一上午搞这天杀的药剂差点搞的我屁股开花，我听到有个白痴敲我家的门敲的跟攻城槌一样，行了！我听见了！虽然我的耳朵已经差不多快聋掉了！找我有什么事么？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"35059aad78cb48d6a9e00a86dbbfbe82fea0a83ce3b8d60f6da05245d71581e2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"225101eb34dd7ab1365e8604669ca06cf3bf157799cb16ce426f34512af3b1ef","logical_entry_identity":"aabb8a9b83743c76cfbc04c685188e6da6af011dbe7b8f650dfa2bcd2cea7b07","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s block","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s 格挡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"364044084384224370f7041922dcdadaf3d1405abf9fa5004068d0afead01c97","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"225277f0847de55091058693f777d72acb2a7484e1320dbceb5ecb5e48ad0f45","logical_entry_identity":"1003796cbb3af00a1857df438fbbbec6f67e59e7b3ecb3b836ca6fc9057c5038","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lay a pressure triggered trap that explodes into a radius 2 wave of razor sharp wire, doing %0.2f physical damage. Those struck by the wire may be shredded, reducing accuracy, armor and defence by %d.\n\t\tThis trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"放置压力感应陷阱，触发后爆炸形成半径 2 格的刀片风暴，造成 %0.2f 物理伤害。被击中的目标的命中、护甲和闪避下降 %d。\n\t\t该陷阱可以被设置为直接激活，也可以被诱饵激活。%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd86255950fb4c696eb7c7b898e8c60d9bb6118a8be1a3d69386c01611337836","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2252c5ea631a40085c8ad9c1a65440887645bb59beb504240078854a2c8b94bf","logical_entry_identity":"28750708364dacc5d18480ea89b645408f4f4d8df93f4a0b68bfc48765588784","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Chill of the Tomb","source_tag":"talent name","target":"极寒坟墓"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0954d10fc542de720725e18e650287ac2d83636d21f4fd723a44ddf809e01971","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"225309cfb4b456c0e4c510a29a80b653622b863d054d1ebe279bdad4c77cc345","logical_entry_identity":"0dabf43ceb7e2f6d9c2393c53cf86941cd4965c399f9b88f6a9726a49bded810","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Attack down","source_tag":"_t","target":"攻击下方目标"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"23ce66bdd1e4aa4b695420bdbccba8ae8cc2dd48733921a48dcf429155d651e0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2261ee2f195ccb38a4d79896d83af9600bb86901354a6655d3bd40f1cecc40c0","logical_entry_identity":"049125bb256cecfbfb269c7ac3b7b19292bffa3b7124d9f073da07a7b980e50c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Conjures up mana into a powerful beam of lightning, doing %0.2f to %0.2f damage (%0.2f average)\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用魔法召唤一次强力的闪电造成 %0.2f ～ %0.2f 伤害（平均 %0.2f）。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9895b3211cdf2ab4f52de13521f28a3ba62b84d2556585ec02cc95f67e612587","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22655572ae8018309ab0b26c13c7aa2348db0b9ef6da0b70cab7fb3ccc583687","logical_entry_identity":"f863f5096f5530b0be22bd9a2ff5936d14df202931cf1cbe1c22d2dab3ecfc1b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mayhem and destruction seem to follow you.\n#CRIMSON#Penalty : #WHITE#Lost Fortune: You seem to find less gold in your journeys.\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sMissplaced Endeavours: The endeavours of those around you begin to fail (+%d%% chance to avoid traps).\n#CRIMSON#Power 2+: %s%+d Luck, %+d Cunning\n#CRIMSON#Power 3+: %sMissed Opportunities: Opportunities are fleeting, and those close to you begin to miss them (+%d%% evasion).\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sUnfortunate End: The damage you deal will increase by %d%% if the increase would be enough to kill your opponent.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"混乱与毁灭似乎追随着你。\n#CRIMSON# 惩罚：#WHITE# 霉运：在你的旅途中找到的金币减少。\n#CRIMSON# 强度 1+：%s 失败的努力：围绕你的努力都会失败  (+%d%% 避开陷阱的几率)。\n#CRIMSON# 强度 2+：%s%+d 幸运，%+d 灵巧\n#CRIMSON# 强度 3+：%s 错失良机：机会转瞬即逝，你身边的人会错失良机 (+%d%% 躲闪概率)。\n#CRIMSON# 强度 4+：%s 厄运终结：如果提高后的伤害足够杀死对手的话，你将可以提高 %d%% 的伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7b2e560db57a5a0ab140ee65a6cb2919ee47c48be4838e24b85c1f9448d2a11a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2266b384ea63376dc147dea82f2ef1b96491d84ff91fe6423315aaaf37c8068c","logical_entry_identity":"615ad7961cf76eb531ab258c0114b08a42925dfb4e9361c8e2cfe4a5ea675bc5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"willpower","source_tag":"talent type","target":"意志"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"58ac173e6745eebe33b251f0ae025290c570329b159261b45704d60ad35470d7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2266cbb5d5cfc7193f1f8cb3cbbf4d387e99207b100003cd3f41bfa0c3d80972","logical_entry_identity":"5a5f52c0640c2490c02b05fd497af84fe07731fb4d549c5793330864635da205","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#F53CBE#%s resists the panic!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#F53CBE#%s抵抗了惊恐！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea0c0adad0a29cb156b22e2eebd25d054fb06368e5589f724b95ed3be7f6ba39","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2267fc8cc122d2b970fe184c44bdbeb411f8e769a5d8a57d3d268da72b6f516c","logical_entry_identity":"248d56f0871c4f8401bb6d0de3000a706937aa832a2c9d115e0d6b839c46e630","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fires a shot that explodes into a radius %d ball of razor sharp fragments on impact, dealing %d%% weapon damage and leaving targets crippled for %d turns, reducing their attack, spell and mind speed by %d%%.\n\t\tEach target struck has a %d%% chance to be marked.\n\t\tThe status chance increases with your Accuracy.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"发射命中后爆裂成 %d 格半径球型范围碎片的弹药，造成 %d%% 武器伤害并致残目标 %d 回合，降低 %d%% 攻击、施法和精神速度。\n\t\t每个被击中的目标有 %d%% 几率被标记。\n\t\t致残几率受命中加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bc8d76e3d4eaa823c0478820d2b2d9ee3baac6faef2c6aab07974e7a919f8db6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22692fce3407bd13f9b02fbe5b340abd02680ab8f5db996cf960cd3716393a4d","logical_entry_identity":"dc7684235c869ce9d01d5be395cbc6cbc29946ce64b5bde103f2678f0543dd93","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and offered to his dark Master","source_tag":"_t","target":"并为他的不死主人永世效忠"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2df0a3c1e7c0d5e5d78666b277624e842c63701a7eb9831f46a2259dccc8876c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"226e899942b162bfd4280d14c7b4146393d1e6b891c5789884c03d1160e6aeba","logical_entry_identity":"de8342055e2e0858cca1376e309e2933150bc0c9f51b9bc634f7073c0ae49b34","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*A tall, hooded man stares at you*#WHITE#\nYes...yes...you look like a promising warrior indeed...\nI have an offer, @playerdescriptor.race@.\nYou see...I am an agent for the Arena. I look for promising warriors that\ncan provide a good show for our audience. Perhaps you are strong enough to join.\nAll you need to do is beat three of my men in battle, and you shall be rewarded.\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*You consider the offer of the mysterious hooded man for a moment*\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*一个高大、头戴兜帽的男人注视着你*#WHITE#\n是的……是的……你的确像是一名很有潜力的战士……\n我有个提议，@playerdescriptor.race@。\n你看……我是竞技场的招募员，专门寻找能为观众献上精彩表演的潜力战士。或许你足够强大，能够加入我们。\n你只需在战斗中击败我的三名手下，就能获得奖励。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*你思量了片刻这个神秘兜帽人的提议*\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"329e44ab6835d363e31a177cbb62fa19dc9a65853afc1b16ac57e05f4816bb0d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2272066cf4c3984a3ebc6edb2d9a6be37eae7ffa6e03655bca9e68141ac1cece","logical_entry_identity":"5b573f1d2f2f4c4f55a1b2757906695f766873756be75e006a9a72b62b1a86df","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Heartstart","source_tag":"talent name","target":"心跳复苏"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fbdfdea1e91218c1421914808298eb8701752e9bdf36438a1a1185154372c063","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2272cab860532b5e9f09878868bbb84b02308b