"tformat","target":"竞技场主宰%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6c5bb911aae68f8d011f1b5782f2b229b70bd347d6b876a0a8e420feffc680a4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22aff51c807b88fe5ee7f350adfd9c24bc85de8c05aa792cf6077dc56e051590","logical_entry_identity":"9f332fa299d4b19b2fce28758151a656d738b00fa48556d74bcfc9092546ab46","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Last Will and Testament of Rolf Two-Axes\n\nI have failed. Oh by the great wyrm's maw, I have failed! The beast Weisman set out to slay was dead already by another's hand, but its corruption remained still. When I arrived in its chamber, Weisman was already half-gone; he was hacking away at foes only he could see. When I tried to stop him, he turned his axe on me... I am beaten and broken, hiding in some crevasse away from... from my own friend, who through the corruption in this place has been perverted into a monstrosity my axes were unable to fell. I hold no doubt that this is the last time I shall put quill to parchment, as even now I can hear my old friend's perverted voice.. calling to me. I bequeathe my belongings to any who slay ...\n#{italic}#(the ink blotch seems to indicate Weisman had caught up to his old friend, one-half of that abomination)#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"双斧罗尔夫的遗嘱\n\n我失败了，以巨龙之战的名义，我承认我失败了！当我赶到这片领地时，原先的怪物已经被杀死了，但这个地方仍然存留着堕落的诅咒。威斯曼已经被整的半死不活，但他仍执着地朝着空气乱砍一气。我想要阻止他，可是那伙计对我举起了他的斧子，我被痛扁了一顿，只能抖抖索索的躲进周围的低洼地中，背弃了我的朋友，眼睁睁的看着他慢慢被这片领域腐化成我的战斧无法打败的骇人怪物。这也许是我最后一次提笔了，我听到老友阵阵疯狂的吼叫……他在呼唤着我……我之财物将赠予任何能杀死…\n#{italic}#（这点点污渍似乎叙说着威斯曼最终抓住了他的老朋友，他们以这种怪物的形式永远地团聚在了一起）#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8c0641067baf6580c46d064e6b7b9ac4212800564bc1ed902f45c716b6c0818e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22c4b569c43796583533e6f4dc653b7ea83581e7757b0c61cbfe0adf2f62bc27","logical_entry_identity":"4d967fb602230411c8484a0c93f04944d3c34917778799cfe94f263b18823693","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"(reflecting %d%% back to the attacker)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"（反射 %d%% 伤害给攻击者）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"67892fae73a8477d930b1718788bbf0043523a2cad2d6f32d356d392f895fe15","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22c5478398d9e52722bb748d0000f1d3b697a0c42037a0b66e46d3c0953c8116","logical_entry_identity":"6be708f1428dd82a45f6c47246786642842a61f047533a87e43a141994353a1a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Prismatic Slash","source_tag":"talent name","target":"五灵挥击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"09e19cf36dc571491b16a78abbca37b5e0b333e9f1cb48da9dd53dd548301568","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22c6b53397e264ef46f5a64eba12806c36550adab781fc5574f050ce28564178","logical_entry_identity":"4298c4004d71c740cb3d1ff4067d353b37500f9acb1a5b99faf98919fd308b5e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Here's a list of the creature bits I need. Good luck with the murdering!","source_tag":"_t","target":"这里有材料清单，祝你好运！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"54367a78ded01d21b237babe6e94d14f54ae772d712a22b840a4966f7ad4b6e5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22c8aada41e272c1e4cd08093fc6937946d9b34418f4c6889a267d41ddbb59f0","logical_entry_identity":"db3463cdbd6d2e15db9d0fc31be4c98cd4a4895a4c5ba8b40738907aa9a0d139","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Teleport","source_tag":"talent name","target":"传送"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"14eca07ff7d6b06649f49916df23bcdd66cbac30b6f1b445ea48ae994a75f9fc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22cdb314f2c4bd100cc2db0ade3add286af4102a5498a657b8beb052ec1338b0","logical_entry_identity":"799c87e6c55d0366a61b5ca2869730ed91d7fed6d6825c108d91baa3b9076c1f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Perfect Accuracy","source_tag":"_t","target":"完美命中"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cc1d25ba1f3fc2dbd184af4fc2365b842c6ae673bc58329b8feac167dbc8014a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22ce5f4f94b88954c905364ea3d47a3d6eb285dcc3120ec184f84ea32bc9ed04","logical_entry_identity":"3efd292e017f436f8eaacbf68d6c20deae88687bbafd975f5e80ec54b