"normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"While this talent is active, you dig deep into your stamina reserves, allowing you to move without taking a turn. However, this costs 12 stamina for each tile that you cross.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当技能激活时，你可以发掘出体能的极限，移动不会耗费回合，但是每移动一码需消耗 12 点体力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eab7c62e218a16ee0da8312f3a763f7bde0d3d08ad2fa87978a7e96d7a85fd87","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22dba90fa2d690779150551f96344d6d57cb0c2ecf405a056ccf1b58da324f70","logical_entry_identity":"2108b0313086328cd5658f915fd1ba7d3d68749fb7695c04732ba68cb48ceea2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rune: Biting Gale","source_tag":"talent name","target":"符文：冰风"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5ad65f6227a4c3a45adab3920657429541338510914bd8a07592a7f1cad76ea6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22dd0f8cc40b7958a781cb66faa136d7294cf27e2c2f3327c00512b80f7af0e0","logical_entry_identity":"a61115dfdf2d130cc523f0c247d96dcf08a5310cb8ab23c62f6e82364bf087bc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"One with Nature","source_tag":"talent name","target":"自然之友"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"acb710de4747440d6fc513267a768919e3752586d38ce81047911e418243ca49","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22e6873b1a88f3fe92c1c85dfefcef52b35167927ec1d071f3f6ad5e1aebf184","logical_entry_identity":"d635bbb2300420c036f499eca005a0f6aa7c7f1b7c0669928dc381d3b33705c6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"@Target@ is caught in an extremely distorted pocket of time!","source_tag":"_t","target":"@Target@被困在极度扭曲的时间中！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f0250f0ef7f457788d28785c84522a68f1d1e4c95e1e64fd34912372bc35a04d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22ee5758768cbf1c729e6386cb6b2d77e581fd9c28d78b0717b04939e2665c24","logical_entry_identity":"391219aabb93a1c7d2814e6b94a269fbb8b90dea4f2163c0fd2b06947b91c21c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thick Skin","source_tag":"talent name","target":"硬化皮肤"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a426ad063e3785092f9c237b0263b7fd3046bd58481240b903820096453a0b8e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22f5fed0f7acba23e637a6e342d6fa70a71ccb4e779dab1dc55b3cfd4e4aeae6","logical_entry_identity":"b88a5829986a7f74722fd4a93d9740f8e2fe456f796559036186617b7db5ed43","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%d lightning damage","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%d 闪电伤害"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bb39bc2cdfe20e22ba54755cc24e8da2d934afc309d8816bd00253425579334c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22f77aa142e02772868e5f8ae35e18fcf4160eec64e6274bfd34a5b320be99a1","logical_entry_identity":"aeb450e06f93d34b9c5b9e6f74d2046c1d8eed0b60ea8dd6b5144f9745c08494","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ignore requirements","source_tag":"_t","target":"无视技能需求"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"783cc4d967f1a004c968f4883ebf61f21242d490936b0ca8d574c7f9e85dc386","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22fcb52ddf08ad39ab14a2cd94609b96cef4bdcebc17fb971be2216caa4f1258","logical_entry_identity":"bf69dc0a94b5695605d9ec5f4650d440bd2d4885b11dd34ea84324b3beac812b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blackened with soot and covered in spikes, this battleaxe roars with the flames of the Fearscape. Given by Urh'Rok himself to his general, this powerful weapon can burn even the most resilient of foes.","source_tag":"_t","target":"黑色的浓烟缠绕在这把双手斧上，恶魔空间的烈焰在其身上咆哮。这把战斧由乌鲁洛克授予他最强大的指挥官，它可以焚尽一切，包括最强大的敌人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1cf49bf93f11258ed45ad9bcb30020f29edc8571be2cd0d747a587251db54820","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"23027342460c1ec6adc43fd0d84356add453f2b4926b87ba948ea0afb51e9cb8","logical_entry_identity":"dd8338fbab9d7134d445dffd70fdeb2813513b90aa932ab792a85a19d9bfab55","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"channel mana (increasing mana regeneration by 2000%% for 5 turns)","source_tag":"_t","target":"法力回复（提升法力回复2000%% 持续5回合）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5bf2e299d388e7569655d9c6d55ebb4ab9a3c9433d5a6da2408c5d2cf5b50565","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2302c974ebae9aed0243bdcebdba516645d7bc36d8c5267247ed95025e4bd159","logical_entry_identity":"6b41f6588bd61535ddd2bb23be967e1011417d14ef5c2076db6f079a77e07f6a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Some rogues live by strength rather than cunning, relying on vicious attacks instead of stealth and subterfuge. These bandits maraud the land, lightly armoured and wielding dual weapons, taking what they can by force.\n\nYou have learned the value in causing sheer damage in combat and can now create characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Marauder class#WHITE#.\n\nMarauders are highly mobile rogues with a range of dextrous techniques and tactics at their disposal. Class features:#YELLOW#\n- Move with ease around the battlefield, dancing around your foes and avoiding their attacks\n- Wield dual weapons and unleash devastating techniques on your opponents\n- Rely on pure thuggery to cripple your enemies before taking them down#WHITE#\n\nMarauders use stamina to fuel their techniques, which replenishes slowly over time.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"有些盗贼依靠力量而非诡计生存，以凶狠的攻击取代潜行与欺骗。这些强盗身着轻甲、双持武器，横行各地，以武力夺取一切。\n\n你已经明白在战斗中造成巨大伤害的价值，现在你在创建人物时可以选择新的职业 #LIGHT_GREEN#掠夺者#WHITE#。\n\n掠夺者是机动性极高的盗贼，掌握着各种灵巧的技术与战术。\n职业特点：#YELLOW#\n- 轻松穿行战场，在敌人之间起舞并避开他们的攻击。\n- 双持武器，对敌人施展毁灭性的技法。\n- 依靠纯粹的暴力重创敌人，再将其击倒。#WHITE#\n\n掠夺者使用体力值来施放他们的技能，体力值会随时间缓慢恢复。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"541f3cbc095a3832009ffb8431598ac8a11e51908818e888b36398a79e15de32","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2306524ceef9170b093e9c3c27eb550073f794854c2558f2636f3330ff0fc385","logical_entry_identity":"19c17716e37689edd28cc7b5cb67dbd8b65b7a4a9dbe3260e4f1eae915d4bf06","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blink","source_tag":"_t","target":"闪烁"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d8cb2558c8059915bccc875d9054a16532110d2340ea88426d0a2c3dadb21362","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"23078dbe62feab1a616902a2fa6e872c07209d67f6118315d3b9a45917a